# Local, machine-specific and generated artifacts — never indexed, never committed.

# dependency trees
node_modules/

# tooling caches
.cache/

# isolated DSH home used for dev/e2e (a copied DSH install, hundreds of MB)
.devhome/

# generated pairing key material
scripts/.dev-extension-key.json
extension/src/lib/dev-config.js

# generated native-messaging launcher — contains THIS machine's absolute node path
# and install path, so it must never be committed (it is written by
# bootstrap/install.mjs / native-host/install.mjs at install time)
native-host/run-host.sh

# test run outputs
spike/out/
tests/e2e/out/

# extension build output
extension/dist/

# 本机专属：含明文凭证（GitHub 经验记录，用户 2026-09-13 要求明文）
# 同时被 scripts/doc-graph.mjs 的 LOCAL_ONLY_DOCS 排除 —— 否则凭证会被索引进
# 被提交的 docs/DOC-GRAPH.md 与 docs/doc-graph.json。
docs/github experience.md

# macOS 垃圾文件（2026-09-13：发现被提交进发布包里）
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
